{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897250/extras/steam-store-title-about.png?t=1743138569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mining visual novel that delves deep into a snow-covered mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your equipment by digging deeper and reflect on the events that brought you here in the first place.\u00a0\u00a0Let this heartwarming journey fill you with flashes of accomplishment on those sleepless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897250/extras/steam-header-main.gif?t=1743138569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897250/extras/steam-store-title-highlights.png?t=1743138569\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mining Game x Visual Novel: </strong>The deeper you dig, the more of the story you'll uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy Mining: </strong>Progress at a pleasant pace by gradually upgrading your equipment, and enjoy the satisfying sound effects of collecting new ores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Brief Respite: </strong>Can be comfortably completed in about two hours. Soothe your mind with the game's mellow music and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897250/extras/steam_header1.png?t=1743138569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2897250/extras/steam-store-title-story.png?t=1743138569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The star